   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **crosstown** (1 review): The fileset has a mixup: the track labeled as this song actually repeats the preceding song with Reggie [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **alladin**: back after 36 archived shows (411 days) [3]\n- **drum solo**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **she's hooked w/reggie watts**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **left behind w/reggie watts**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **what can you do w/reggie watts**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **hold on**: back after 44 archived shows (511 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **crosstown**: back after 36 archived shows (411 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **tuesday**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2005-10-14.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 110 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the sound pretty good given the band and source, noting Soulive is difficult to tape [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2005-10-14.flac16**: taped by Brian Wolfzorn; transferred by Brian Wolfzorn; source: sony ecm907> sony mzr55>dell>soundforge7.0>flac [1]",
